我才要感謝你們呢，是你們讓我重拾自信，\n再次有了向前邁進的意志。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,15]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n好了，別再跟他們客套了。\n讓他們走，別耽誤他們的還陽時機。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[723,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[724,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n我了解了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,3,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n二位快走吧。\n你們陽壽未盡，現在還來得及還陽。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[723,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&陈到\n嗯，咱們有緣再見。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[724,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&谢煌恩\n謝皇恩。\n(我先告辭了，咱們有緣再會。)"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[723,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[724,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":1020,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["旋轉+消失"]},"end":76,"end_off":1428},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":1038,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["旋轉"]},"end":59,"end_off":1197},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":1197,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["旋轉"]},"end":72,"end_off":1348},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[723,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[724,0,3]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,723,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,724,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[167]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,161,0,46,66,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n子龍，你表現得很好，\n我果然沒看錯你。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[8]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公是否有打算還陽？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n還陽？哈哈哈哈！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我的陽壽早就耗盡了，\n哪有什麼資格還陽呢！\n我等一下還要去跟閻羅王報到呢！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n……………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我現在雖然死了，意識卻比活著更清楚。\n過去想不明白的事，現在全想明白了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我的失敗不是天意，也不是因為手下不行。\n而是我自己剛愎自用，又不面對現實，\n最終才將自己逼入死路。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n子龍，你不必因為我的結局而感到自責。\n要不是因為你，我只會失敗得更快。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n這麼多年來你一直對我不離不棄，謝謝你。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,4]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[7]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n多謝主公的賞識！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n去找玄德吧，他才是你應該追隨的人。\n你的身上還有無限多種可能，\n不值得為我這樣的凡夫俗子而耽誤一生。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n去吧，騎著白馬向前奔馳，\n你是真正的勇者，真正的白馬義從！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n末將遵命！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n永別了，主公。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n這不是永別！\n將來我們還是會在這裡重逢的！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n哈哈。（主公居然也會開玩笑了。）"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,547,0,36,62,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,34,0,38,66,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,34,0,36,66,3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,15]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n小子！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,8]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n經過這次的戰鬥，你的武藝已更上一層。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n現在的你，[C0D只需裝備龍膽涯角槍，\n再加上攻擊Buff，就可使用吸血攻擊。]"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n另外，[C0D當心西涼的龐德龐令明]，\n他可是當今的西北第一高手，\n也是你將來會面臨的強敵。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n多謝指點。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,34,0,32,66,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[547,0,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args"